<title>USA: U.S. soybean sales to China 287,800 tonnes in week.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to China 287,800 tonnes in week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean sales to China for the week ending Oct. 17 totaled 287,800 tonnes, USDA said in its weekly export sales report Thursday.</p>
<p>Soymeal sales to China were 134,000 tonnes in the same week, USDA said.</p>
<p>Soyoil sales to China totaled 20,000 tonnes in the week.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8394</p>
</text>
